                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Consulate</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Havre :</hi></p>
                <p>I, James O. Putnam, consul of the United States at Havre, do hereby certify that
                    Messrs. Rigot &amp; Co., who have signed the within account, are merchants of
                    high standing and respectability of this city.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given under my hand and official seal, at
                            <placeName>Havre</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-02-18">the 18th day of February,
                    1864</date>.</dateline><lb/>[SEAL] <lb/>
                    <signed>JAMES O. PUTNAM, <hi rendition="#italic">United States Consul,
                            Havre.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
